<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS says it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis registered shares.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,500.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	5.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     10.55 CHF		 GEARING	7.72 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	12.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,627.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
